Hi, Chris:

Please follow the steps below to set up and let me know if this works or no=
t?

Step 1.  Click USB Server icon.

[cid:image001.jpg@01CF54D3.6D046170]

Step 2.  Click "Options" and choose "Server Configurations".

[cid:image002.jpg@01CF54D4.B731FC20]

Step 3-1. Untick "Use DHCP"
        3-2. Type the static IP address & Subnet.
        3-3. Click "Set" to finish your setting.
[cid:image003.jpg@01CF54D5.B82F7980]

Thank you.

Best regards

Roger Chen

